### How to load programs.
@load 'lang/some.code'  # the standard library itself lives in ./lang/
@load './this.code'      # relative to wherever you ran bin/program from (cwd)
@load 'that.code'        # relative to wherever you ran bin/program from (cwd)
@load 'and_this'         # no .code extension required
###
